# unit_pause: the pause stages' paths no play reaches, as calls from a
# Novice race: PauseStageResumeA counting and at its end; PauseStageLeave
# to the race again ($0DD4 set) and its lone RTS at 07:BD08;
# PauseStageChoiceP1's move right; PauseStageChoiceP2 (taken on quit and
# continue, left, right, nothing); PauseStageContinueP2 counting and at its
# end; PauseStageQuitMenuP2 with the window open; PauseQuitMenuP2 (taken at
# each cursor, the cars first and again, each cursor's moves, the cars
# drawn at frame counts 7 and 0); PauseQuitMenu's moves up from 2 and 4 and
# its bytes no code reaches (07:C021, 07:C03E).
